          <unicode>ᠥᠯᠢᠺᠠᠷᠯᠠᠨ ᠦᠭᠦᠯᠡᠪᠡᠰᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n ygylebesy</transcript>
          <definition> Comparatively speaking, for example, for instance.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠡᠭᠦᠨ ᠢ ᠲᠡᠭᠦᠨ ᠎ᠯᠦᠭᠡ ᠥᠯᠢᠺᠠᠷᠯᠠᠨ</unicode>
